	(text "ENV-Two (Autospkr Labs) - regenerated from envTwo_schematic.png (KiCad 6 export, 2023-08-01).\nConnections are made with net labels on short wire stubs; labels with the same name are connected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "717ce262-d668-4dd7-9e30-ed6d0886d8e4")
	)
	(text "Pico mapping: J4 (rpi_pico_left) pin n = Pico physical pin 20+n; J5 (rpi_pico_right) pin n = physical pin n.\nGPIO: TFT DC/RST/CS/T_CS = GP18/19/20/21, SPI0 MISO/SCK/MOSI = GP0/2/3, DAC CS/SCK/SDI = GP9/14/15,\nENC1 A/B = GP10/11, ENC2 A/B = GP12/13, BTN1/2 = GP6/7, LOOP1/GATE1 = GP28/22, LOOP2/GATE2 = GP5/4, TRIG1/2 = GP26/27."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f15918ce-f6eb-4ffc-b8fc-16e52b2addcc")
	)
	(text "Changes from the 2023 PNG:\n - J4 pin 8 (Pico pin 28 = GND) moved from +3V3 to GND (the PNG shorted 3V3 to GND here).\n - Output stage A (U3A -> J13, envelope 1) is fed from DAC VA (U4 pin 8), the channel the firmware drives.\n - Added output stage B (U3B -> J14, envelope 2) from DAC VB (U4 pin 6): a copy of stage A (R12-R16, C5, C6).\nUnchanged: C2 (100nF) sits from the inverting input to GND in parallel with R7; C5 mirrors it in stage B."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
